            "title": "US, China ‘agree to establish trade deal enforcement offices’ ...",
            "snippets": [
              "# US, China ‘agree to establish trade deal enforcement offices’\n*Mnuchin tells US media that the US has ‘pretty much’ agreed on enforcement mechanism with China to deal with trade deal.*\nSave\nShare\n\nU.S and China trade talks in Beijing\n\nChinese Vice Premier and lead trade negotiator Liu He, US Trade Representative Robert Lighthizer, and US Treasury Secretary Steven Mnuchin before trade negotiations in Beijing last February [Mark Schiefelbein/Reuters]",
              "Published On 10 Apr 2019 10 Apr 2019\n\nUS Treasury Secretary Steven Mnuchin said on Wednesday that US-China trade talks continue to make progress and the two sides have basically settled on a mechanism to police any agreement, including new enforcement offices",
